  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Fatima",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Fatima.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Aleeza Fatima (MED0002679665) is a compassionate, community-focused doctor dedicated to providing comprehensive, long-term care for patients of all ages. She completed her medical degree at the University of Newcastle and brings a diverse clinical background from major metropolitan and regional hospitals across Australia. Her dynamic background spans key medical and surgical disciplines, giving her a well-rounded approach to general medicine.",
      "Outside of direct patient care, Dr Aleeza is deeply invested in medical research, having co-authored several published papers in peer-reviewed journals, and served as a clinical tutor, mentoring and teaching medical students at the University of New South Wales."
    ]
  },
